window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The worst was behind him, or so he thought. As graduation neared, an unexpected death sends Jody’s life into a spiral. Old traumas, almost healed, are ripped open. Fresh horrors rise to the surface and pull him apart from the inside out. Ghosts surround him, calling to him in all the places he once thought safe. Jody struggles to pull the tattered pieces of his world back together, fighting addiction, mental illness, and the ghosts of a world he thought long ago buried. Haunted by mistakes and regret, he tries desperately to find peace and healing. In the darkness, a hand reaches out to him, bridging past, present, and future, offering hope and a simple admonition. “The truth will set you free.”</p>"; 
